

on damage:
	attacker is a player
	projectile exists
	projectile is an arrow
	if name of attacker's tool is "&5Explosive Bow":
		play large explosion at the victim to the attacker
		loop all mobs in radius 2 of the victim:
			wait 1 ticks
			damage loop-entity by 50
		stop
	else:
		stop

on damage:
	attacker is a player
	if name of attacker's tool is "&aCleaver":
		loop all mobs in radius 2 around victim:
			damage loop-entity by 3

on damage:
	attacker is a player
	if name of attacker's tool is "&aFlaming Sword":
		ignite the victim for 3 seconds

on rightclick holding a wooden sword:
	if held item's name is "&fAspect of the Jerry":
		make the player execute command "/iKjusHbc"

command /iKjusHbc:
	cooldown: 5 seconds
	cooldown message: &cThis ability is on cooldown!
	trigger:
		make the server execute command "/playsound minecraft:entity.villager.yes player %player% %x-coordinate of player% %y-coordinate of player% %z-coordinate of player%"

on death:
	attacker is a player
	victim is a mob
	if name of attacker's tool is "&6Daedalus Axe":
		add 35 to attacker's balance